    <h1>MIT Day of AI — Gear Grease</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Team Lead &amp; Guest Presenter · 2024</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <p class="intro">
      For the MIT Day of AI, I led a team of four developing Gear Grease — a
      proposal for a sustainability-oriented video game with a then-novel
      idea: using natural language processing and large language model APIs to
      generate NPC dialogue.
    </p>

    <h2>Boston Museum of Science</h2>
    <p>
      Invited to speak as a guest presenter at the Day of AI event hosted at
      the Boston Museum of Science, alongside MIT RAISE director Cynthia
      Breazeal, MIT Media Lab director Dava Newman, and other distinguished
      leaders. The virtual program reached more than 8,000 teachers across
      110+ countries.
    </p>
